<title>PHILIPPINES: Primetown announces projects in Mindanao.</title>
<headline>Primetown announces projects in Mindanao.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philippines' Primetown Property Group Inc will put up condominium-hotels in three areas in Mindanao in the southern Philippines, Primetown president Kenneth Yap said on Monday.</p>
<p>The hotel and condominium units will be built in General Santos City, Cagayan de Oro and Davao,&quot; Yap said in a statement.</p>
<p>&quot;Mindanao offers a very attractive and promising investment site because of the growing peace and order stability and economic growth of the region,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>Primetown has projects in Metro Manila and Boracay in the Visayas. - Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 fax 8176267</p>
